+ *
+ * 7.18.1.1 Exact-width integer types
+ *
+ * Visual Studio 6 and Embedded Visual C++ 4 doesn't
+ * realize that, e.g. char has the same size as __int8
+ * so we give up on __intX for them.
+ */
